    "title": "Saturday: Walnut Creek Oktoberfest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CC News ,\n21 hours ago Raise a stein and celebrate the season at Walnut Creek’s Oktoberfest, a lively festival filled with music, community, and classic Bavarian-inspired fun. Set in the heart of downtown, this high-energy event brings together live bands, traditional dancing, local food, artisan vendors, and a vibrant biergarten featuring dozens of craft beers and more. Whether you’re in the mood to sip, shop, dance, or just soak it all in, there’s something for everyone, including a family-friendly Kinder Karneval. Throw on your dirndl or lederhosen and join us for one of the most anticipated events of the year. Read full article",
